{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01322",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 3.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "good morning, grab a a seat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.8,
      "end_seconds": 5.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.7,
      "end_seconds": 10.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "what would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.94,
      "end_seconds": 23.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "I'm here because of pain in my right shoulder. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.73,
      "end_seconds": 27.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.03,
      "end_seconds": 37.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "It's, It's been about a week now. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.34,
      "end_seconds": 48.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.09,
      "end_seconds": 64.54,
      "duration_seconds": 14.45,
      "text": "Ah, it sort of comes and goes. Rest helps a bit. About a seven out of ten. Yes, reaching behind and lifting my arm. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.08,
      "end_seconds": 71.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "what about pain at night when you lie on it, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.63,
      "end_seconds": 74.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "yes, actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.37,
      "end_seconds": 79.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is it it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.12,
      "end_seconds": 82.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.52,
      "end_seconds": 97.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.65,
      "end_seconds": 99.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.29,
      "end_seconds": 114.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.72,
      "end_seconds": 119.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.79,
      "end_seconds": 140.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.42,
      "end_seconds": 153.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.68,
      "text": "yes, uh, I had part of my thyroid removed, years back. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.72,
      "end_seconds": 158.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.33,
      "end_seconds": 165.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Uh, I take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.49,
      "end_seconds": 168.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.84,
      "end_seconds": 173.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.51,
      "end_seconds": 177.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.51,
      "end_seconds": 183.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.22,
      "end_seconds": 187.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "did you get fall or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.41,
      "end_seconds": 193.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "no fall or chest pain, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.11,
      "end_seconds": 198.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.65,
      "end_seconds": 203.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Erm, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.6,
      "end_seconds": 222.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.72,
      "end_seconds": 233.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.96,
      "end_seconds": 257.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 122 over 77, saturation 98 percent, respiratory rate 16. And And heart rate 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.52,
      "end_seconds": 260.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.25,
      "end_seconds": 264.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.32,
      "end_seconds": 269.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.42,
      "end_seconds": 273.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Okay, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.49,
      "end_seconds": 289.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Lifting the arm to the side is painful between sixty and a hundred twenty degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.89,
      "end_seconds": 305.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.57,
      "text": "Okay, that's all I needed to check. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with a rotator cuff problem at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.87,
      "end_seconds": 312.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.26,
      "end_seconds": 337.61,
      "duration_seconds": 23.35,
      "text": "I understand the the worry at the moment I'd say it's a rotator cuff problem, and we'll watch how it goes we'll begin with naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day after food, for five days that's for shoulder pain that's everything on my side anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.33,
      "end_seconds": 342.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.01,
      "end_seconds": 345.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}